+	pushes the camera 2 to 3 x further away and the aircraft looks SMALLER on a phone than the old kit did.
+	Cap = clamp(halfLength x LengthMul + Add, Min, Max) (VehicleConfig.Drive.ChaseZoom). vkit ground fix1: a mode listed
+	as a table ({ LengthMul, Add, Min, Max }) uses its own numbers (a key it leaves out: the shared one); true = shared.
+	vkit air fix1b: a mode in cfg.PartBodyOnly gets a cap only when partBody is true (the model carries WE_PartBody), so
